                                                "sense_id": "27e17355-3065-3949-945e-f79a079e1ce1",
                                                "text": "But as in the case of Japan, the results of self-dealing corruption largely remain in the country rather than escaping to Swiss bank accounts as often happened with the style of 1950s era corruption seen in Vietnam or the Philippines."
